{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33922","headline":"登第後寒食杏园有宴因寄录事宋垂文同年 · 皮日休","name":"登第後寒食杏园有宴因寄录事宋垂文同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨洗清明万象鲜，满城车马簇红筵。\n恩荣虽得陪高会，科禁惟忧犯列仙。\n当醉不知开火日，正贫那似看花年。\n纵来恐被青娥笑，未纳春风一宴钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}